2; printed p.435 / PDF p.455"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KTrivial}\">\\(\\mathrm{KTrivial}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T,\\equiv_T\">\\(\\le_T,\\equiv_T\\)</span> 与迭代跳跃见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ccd45302acc926e6\" href=\"?note=ccd45302acc926e6\" title=\"43-df-ktrivial\">43-df-ktrivial</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>。量化的序列与集合按特征函数同一识别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land A^{(2)}\\equiv_T\\varnothing^{(2)}\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{KTrivial}(X)\\Rightarrow X\\le_TA\\bigr)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land A^{(2)}\\equiv_T\\varnothing^{(2)}\\land\\forall X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{KTrivial}(X)\\Rightarrow X\\le_TA\\bigr)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里低二要求第二跳跃等价于0″，不等同低或超低。录入书中明确给出的K平凡推论，避免把前一条“非平凡Σ⁰₃理想”含糊地推广到含0′的整个c.e.度结构。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Corollary 15.4.2; printed p.435 / PDF p.455。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ktrivial]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ktrivial","status":"resolved","id":"ccd45302acc926e6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KTrivial}$、$\\operatorname{CE}$、$\\le_T,\\equiv_T$ 与迭代跳跃见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]。量化的序列与集合按特征函数同一识别。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KTrivial}$、$\\operatorname{CE}$、$\\le_T,\\equiv_T$ 与迭代跳跃见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]、[[43-df-jump]]。量化的序列与集合按特征函数同一识别。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{KTrivial}$、$\\operatorname{CE}$、$\\le_T,\\equiv_T$ 与迭代跳跃见 [[43-df-ktrivial]]、[[4